    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "TOM MAHER & COMPANY SCSI RICS IPAV - This instantly appealing 3 bed end of terrace red brick CORNER home offers tremendous potential to extend to the side subject to the customary planning consents. The property has been well maintained and upgraded over the years, presented in walk in condition. The perfect STARTER HOME ready for immediate occupation, NO ONWARD CHAIN. \r\n\r\nSituated in a quiet, mature and family-friendly neighbourhood within walking distance of a wide range of amenities and services both social and essential including schools such as St. Mark’s Community School and Sacred Heart National School, The Square Tallaght, Leisure facilities, Tallaght Hospital, TU, Tallaght Stadium, Tymon Park, the Civic Theatre and IMC. Public transport is easily accessible with multiple Dublin Bus routes and the nearby LUAS Red Line providing quick access to the city centre and surrounding areas. The M50, N7 and N81 are nearby providing ease of access to various routes. early viewing is highly advised to avoid disappointment.  REGISTER YOR INTERST BY EMAIL."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance porch with tiled flooring to hallway with wood flooring, open plan under star stairs storage plus separate cloakroom. \r\nLounge :3.27m x 4.68m wood flooring \r\nKitchen /dining room : 2.73m x 5.16m Neat arrangement of kitchen units and presses, integrated extractor fan, hob and oven, tiled splash area, wall mounted Worchester Bosch Gas Boiler, French doors leads to the rear garden. \r\nUPSTAIRS. \r\nBathroom : 1.73m x 2.05m  bath pedestal wash hand basin, WC, the floor and wall areas are fully tiled \r\nBedroom 1 : 3.24m x 3.65m  alcove Ideal for a built-in wardrobe \r\nHot press\r\nBedroom 2 : 2.79m x 4.22m wood flooring \r\nBedroom 3 : 2.95m x 2.36m built-in wardrobe, wood flooring."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "PVC double glazed windows\r\nPVC fascia and soffit\r\nThe property has Gas radiator central heating. (Worchester Bosch boiler) \r\nThe fireplace has been closed up it can be re-instated if so desired\r\nFully tiled bathroom\r\nAttic remains untouched.\r\nProperty held on a Freehold basis.\r\nWalled garden to the front\r\nWalled garden to the rear"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "As per the Map - www.tommaher.ie"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "STRICTLY BY PRIOR APPOINTMENT"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "OFFERS",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "FOLLOWING VIEWING of the property - If you intend to bid, you will need to go to the ad on www.daft.ie click on make an offer, you will then need to register... once registered, and satisfactory documentation is received, we will then approve you. You are then in a position to place an offer."
      },
